{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You were one of thousands of worker-class robots created to work in this mine. This was once your workplace. Later, it became the headquarters of a rebellion. Now, it is a desolate and dangerous graveyard abandoned after the war. Illuminate your path and escape. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore this desolate mine, built in layers underground.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A unique 2D action-adventure experience awaits, with darkness in black and white.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use 7549\u2019s agility to evade dangers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your greatest enemy is the darkness itself. Be careful not to lose your way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Confront humans who seek to destroy you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Don\u2019t fall into traps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your intelligence as a weapon, and don\u2019t let humans capture you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Thrilling parkours will be accompanied by challenging puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655100/extras/littlegif.gif?t=1746053831\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3655100?t=1746053831","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655100/3640663ae9adb1a91ad8e1cf763a7563d1d26c33/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746053831","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655100/6bb318e98bf6ad08d9df9d660bca141558552207/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746053831","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655100/6bb318e98bf6ad08d9df9d660bca141558552207/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746053831","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"descriptio